      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The Atlas currently labels the source role Municipalities and assigns all seven district features to same-name single-child province references under the pinned Yugoslavia area label. The exact three #999 IDs are the Prishtina, Ferizaj and Gjilan subset; the other four belong to #1008. These reference fields do not validate current legal or historical territorial meaning.",
