        "issue-999-scope-contract",
        "issue-1008-scope-contract"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "No lawful machine-readable official boundary vector or explicit reuse terms were established, so the geometry relationship between the 2021 geoBoundaries features and current official statistical/municipal boundaries remains unverified.",
